### Go build ###
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with the -coverprofile flag
*.out

### Go workspace ###
# If you have a vendor directory, you might want to ignore it when using modules
vendor/

### Project binaries and build artifacts ###
/bin/
/build/
/dist/

### WireGuard and system artifacts ###
# local wg-quick and interface related files
*.conf
*.key

### Configs / secrets ###
# Ignore typical user-level config files that may contain secrets
/.env
/.env.local
*.pem
*.crt
credentials.json

### IDEs and editors ###
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

### OS files ###
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db

### Logs and coverage ###
/logs/
*.log
coverage.out

### Misc ###
node_modules/
.cache/

# Don't ignore these by default; uncomment if you want to ignore local generated configs
# configs/*.yaml
